                            'showCandlesShadows': 'Enables\x20or\x20disables\x20the\x20display\x20of\x20the\x20shadow\x20of\x20the\x20latest\x20candles,\x20overlaying\x20a\x20wick\x20with\x20lower\x20opacity\x20over\x20the\x20most\x20recent\x20candles\x20on\x20the\x20chart.\x20When\x20enabled,\x20this\x20function\x20improves\x20the\x20visual\x20representation\x20without\x20modifying\x20the\x20price\x20information.\x20This\x20setting\x20will\x20be\x20automatically\x20applied\x20when\x20creating\x20a\x20new\x20layout.\x20If\x20you\x20want\x20to\x20apply\x20it\x20to\x20all\x20charts,\x20click\x20\x22Apply\x20to\x20all\x22\x20or\x20configure\x20it\x20separately\x20for\x20each\x20layout\x20in\x20the\x20price\x20scale\x20properties,\x20according\x20to\x20your\x20preference.',
